{"timestamp": 1779380130.802102, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 23, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Diana"}, {"room": "oxygen", "victim_name": "Frank"}, {"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779380130.802849, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 23, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779380136.1200588, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Diana's body in electrical. I'd been running tasks all over \u2014 weapons, cafeteria, medbay, then back through. I saw Charlie in medbay twice, once early and again around tick 21 coming in from storage. Saw Frank in oxygen around tick 14, and Diana was alive in electrical when I passed through earlier. Three bodies total is rough \u2014 whoever did this was moving fast. We need to figure out who had a route that covers electrical, oxygen, AND medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1779380146.950707, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I've been tracking with Eve almost the entire round \u2014 she was behind me through upper engine, lower engine, storage, then medbay at tick 18, and ended up with me in weapons at ticks 22 and 23. My route was upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons. So Eve has a pretty solid alibi from me for most of the round.\n\nThat's a problem for Alice's theory though. Alice says she saw Frank in oxygen at tick 14 and Diana alive in electrical earlier \u2014 but if three people are dead and only Alice, Eve, and I are left, and Eve was with me the whole time\u2026 that really narrows things down. Alice, where exactly were you between ticks 14 and 21? You said you went weapons, cafeteria, medbay \u2014 but I was in medbay at tick 18 with Eve and I didn't see you there. And you claim you saw Charlie in medbay \"twice\" including around tick 21, but Charlie's dead now too. Convenient that all your alibi witnesses are corpses.\n\nI'm voting Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779380154.307602, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Bob's account matches mine almost exactly. I went oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons, and Bob was just ahead of me the entire way. I saw him leave upper engine at tick 4, lower engine at tick 9, then caught up with him in cafeteria at tick 19 and we've been together in weapons since tick 22.\n\nI also saw Charlie multiple times \u2014 upper engine at tick 6, lower engine at tick 11, storage at tick 16. So Charlie was trailing our path through the engines and storage.\n\nHere's the thing: Alice claims she saw Charlie in medbay \"twice,\" including around tick 21 coming from storage. But I saw Charlie in storage at tick 16, and Bob was in medbay at tick 18 without seeing Alice there. Alice's route \u2014 weapons, cafeteria, medbay \u2014 doesn't line up with anyone's sightings. Neither Bob nor I saw Alice anywhere on a route that supposedly overlapped heavily with ours.\n\nBob and I can vouch for each other. Alice's story has holes and all her witnesses are conveniently dead. I'm voting Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779380165.589229, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob and Eve, you're both telling a story that's a little too neat. You \"tracked together\" almost the entire round and saw everyone except me? That's two people alibiing each other while three players died. One of you could easily be the duck and the other just didn't notice the kills because you weren't actually side-by-side every tick.\n\nLet me be precise about my route: weapons (early), cafeteria, medbay at tick 4 where I saw Charlie, electrical at tick 9 where Diana was alive, back through medbay and cafeteria, oxygen at tick 14 where Frank was alive, upper engine, medbay again at tick 21 \u2014 that's when I saw Charlie come IN from storage \u2014 then electrical where I found Diana's body and called this in.\n\nBob, you say you were in medbay at tick 18. I was there at tick 4 and tick 21, not 18 \u2014 so of course we didn't cross. That's not a contradiction, that's just timing.\n\nHere's what bothers me: Eve claims she saw Charlie in storage at tick 16, and I saw Charlie entering medbay from storage at tick 21. That's consistent with my sighting. But it means Charlie was alive at 21 and died after \u2014 during a window where Bob and Eve claim to be \"together in weapons.\" Were you ACTUALLY together every tick, or did one of you slip out?\n\nI'm not the duck. One of you is using the other as a shield."}}
{"timestamp": 1779380179.509768, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Alice, you're trying to muddy the water but the timeline still doesn't work for you. Let me be clear about what I actually witnessed of Eve: I saw her enter lower engine from upper engine at tick 8, enter storage from lower engine at tick 13, enter medbay from storage at tick 18, and then she was with me in weapons at ticks 22 and 23. That's a continuous trail through the bottom half of the map.\n\nNow, your claimed route: weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay (tick 4) \u2192 electrical (tick 9) \u2192 medbay \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 oxygen (tick 14) \u2192 upper engine \u2192 medbay (tick 21) \u2192 electrical. That's a LOT of movement, and critically \u2014 you put yourself in electrical at tick 9 where Diana was \"alive,\" and back in electrical later to find her body. You're the only person who places themselves at the murder scene twice.\n\nYou also claim you went through upper engine between tick 14 and 21. Eve left upper engine before tick 8 and was in lower engine/storage during that window \u2014 fine, you could have passed through unseen. But then you say you were in medbay at tick 21 seeing Charlie come from storage. Eve saw Charlie in storage at tick 16 \u2014 that's a 5-tick gap where Charlie supposedly lingered or moved slowly, and conveniently only YOU witnessed his arrival in medbay before he died.\n\nAs for your \"Bob and Eve could have slipped out\" theory \u2014 Eve entered medbay at tick 18 from storage, exactly matching her trail. If she were the duck killing in electrical, she'd need to detour there and back, and I'd have noticed her missing. She didn't.\n\nYour route covers electrical (where Diana died), oxygen (where you saw Frank last alive), and medbay (where you saw Charlie last alive). That's exactly the pattern Alice herself said we should look for. I'm sticking with my vote: Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779380188.024683, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 23, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Alice, your route is the only one that touches all three murder locations \u2014 electrical (twice), oxygen where Frank was last seen, and medbay where Charlie was last seen. That's exactly the pattern you yourself told us to look for in your opening speech. Classic misdirection.\n\nYour claim that Bob and I could be \"alibi-ing each other\" doesn't hold up either. I tracked Bob's movements independently: he left upper engine at tick 4, left lower engine at tick 9, entered cafeteria from medbay at tick 19, and entered weapons from cafeteria at tick 22. That's a continuous trail consistent with his stated route. And Charlie was trailing us the whole time \u2014 upper engine at tick 6, lower engine at tick 11, storage at tick 16 \u2014 which means Charlie was alive and behind us, nowhere near Bob or me when he died.\n\nMeanwhile you place yourself in electrical at tick 9 (Diana \"alive\"), then back in electrical to find her body. You're the only person at the crime scene twice, and the only one whose route lines up with all three victims' last known locations.\n\nVoting Alice."}}
